empty environment
  http://a.test/ -> direct
  https://a.test/ -> direct
  http://skip.test/ -> direct
  http://deep.skip.test/ -> direct
HTTP_PROXY and NO_PROXY
  http://a.test/ -> http://upper.test:3128
  https://a.test/ -> direct
  http://skip.test/ -> direct
  http://deep.skip.test/ -> direct
lowercase wins, ALL_PROXY fills https
  http://a.test/ -> http://lower.test:3128
  https://a.test/ -> socks5://all.test:1080
  http://skip.test/ -> direct
  http://deep.skip.test/ -> direct
HTTPS_PROXY without scheme
  http://a.test/ -> http://lower.test:3128
  https://a.test/ -> http://secure.test:8443
  http://skip.test/ -> direct
  http://deep.skip.test/ -> direct
NO_PROXY star
  http://a.test/ -> direct
  https://a.test/ -> direct
  http://skip.test/ -> direct
  http://deep.skip.test/ -> direct
rules: localhost, .internal.test, 10.0.0.0/8, direct.test:8080, *.wild.test, 192.168.1.5, [::1], 2001:db8::/32
  http://localhost/ -> direct
  http://a.localhost/ -> direct
  http://localhost.other/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://api.internal.test/ -> direct
  http://internal.test/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://10.2.3.4/ -> direct
  http://11.0.0.1/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://direct.test:8080/ -> direct
  http://direct.test:9090/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://direct.test/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://x.wild.test/ -> direct
  http://wild.test/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://192.168.1.5/ -> direct
  http://192.168.1.6/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://[::1]/ -> direct
  http://[::2]/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  http://[2001:db8::7]/ -> direct
  http://[2001:db9::7]/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  https://secure.example/ -> http://proxy.test:3128
  https://UPPER.internal.test/ -> direct
star
  http://a.test/ -> direct
  https://a.test/ -> direct
separate http and https proxies
  http://a.test/ -> http://plain.test:8080
  https://a.test/ -> socks5://secure.test:1080
  https://user:pw@a.test/ -> socks5://secure.test:1080
forwarding
200 GET host=origin.test:PORT path=/hello?x=1 body= auth=- proxy-auth=-
  proxy saw: GET http://origin.test:PORT/hello?x=1 auth=-
  client resolved: proxy.test
200 POST host=origin.test:PORT path=/submit body=payload auth=- proxy-auth=- via=testproxy
  proxy saw: POST http://origin.test:PORT/submit auth=-
proxy connections 1, origin connections 2
direct for no_proxy hosts
200 GET host=direct.test:PORT path=/direct body= auth=- proxy-auth=-
  client resolved: direct.test
proxy connections 1
authentication
407 Proxy Authentication Required
200 GET host=origin.test:PORT path=/need-auth body= auth=- proxy-auth=-
  proxy saw: GET http://origin.test:PORT/need-auth auth=-
  proxy saw: GET http://origin.test:PORT/need-auth auth=Basic dXNlcjpwYXNz
